GEO:39.168613;-86.517376
SUMMARY:Twin Cheeks: Who Killed the Homecoming King? | Underground Film S
 eries
DESCRIPTION:Parodying the acclaimed television show Twin Peaks\, a colleg
 e student goes undercover as a stripper and male hustler to infiltrate th
 e crime duo responsible for his brother's death. Filmed in a lot of the s
 ame locations David Lynch used but with the absurdity turned way up\, fil
 mmaker Kelly Hughes proves to be an unsung legend of the underground. [60
  min\; comedy\, horror\, experimental\; English]
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Parodying the acclaimed television show
  <i>Twin Peaks</i>\, a college student goes undercover as a stripper and 
 male hustler to infiltrate the crime duo responsible for his brother's de
 ath. Filmed in a lot of the same locations David Lynch used but with the 
 absurdity turned way up\, filmmaker Kelly Hughes proves to be an unsung l
 egend of the underground. [60 min\; comedy\, horror\, experimental\; Engl
 ish]</p>
