DTEND:20261204T210000Z
LOCATION:SIDNEY AND LOIS ESKENAZI MUSEUM OF ART
GEO:39.169144;-86.519739
SUMMARY:HappyApero
DESCRIPTION:Please join us for an afternoon of discussion surrounding dig
 ital media\, online identity\, and mental health alongside our ongoing Ha
 ppiness 2.0 Project. An introduction will be led by Eskenazi Museum's Wil
 ma E. Kelley Director Mindy Besaw\, highlighting the importance of integr
 ating arts and sciences\, followed by a further presentation from the Hap
 piness 2.0 Team. Anyone interested is welcome to attend.  The Happiness 2
 .0 Project is a collaboration of the Eskenazi Museum of Art\, The Media S
 chool\, and IU Counseling and Psychological Services. More information ab
 out this initiative can be found on the Happiness 2.0 web page. (https://
 mediaschool.indiana.edu/research/happiness-2.html)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Please join us for an afternoon of disc
 ussion surrounding digital media\, online identity\, and mental health al
 ongside our ongoing Happiness 2.0 Project. An introduction will be led by
  Eskenazi Museum's Wilma E. Kelley Director Mindy Besaw\, highlighting th
 e importance of integrating arts and sciences\, followed by a further pre
 sentation from the Happiness 2.0 Team. Anyone interested is welcome to at
 tend.</p><p>  The Happiness 2.0 Project is a collaboration of the Eskenaz
 i Museum of Art\, The Media School\, and IU Counseling and Psychological 
 Services. More information about this initiative can be found on the <a h
 ref="https://mediaschool.indiana.edu/research/happiness-2.html">Happiness
  2.0 web page.</a></p>
