SUMMARY:KIX Mix Community Gathering: 12/11
DESCRIPTION:These gatherings are meant to strengthen our community throug
 h networking\, collaborative matchmaking\, and connecting with the KIX se
 ed grants.  Each week features a different project presentation or guest 
 lecture\, followed by Q&amp\;A. Can't make it in person? Join us by Zoom:
  https://iu.zoom.us/j/89765842070. (https://iu.zoom.us/j/89765842070.)  A
 n optional lab tour follows at 10 am\; to make sure we can accommodate ev
 eryone\, please sign up for the tour here: https://iubmsch-fireform.eas.i
 u.edu/online/form/authen/mschkixtour (https://iubmsch-fireform.eas.iu.edu
 /online/form/authen/mschkixtour)&#160\;This Week's Topic: Embodied Dramat
 urgies: Exploring Motion Capture and Virtual Production as Tools for the 
 Transmission of Collective Performance KnowledgePresenter: Ana Candida Ca
 rneiro  No registration is required to attend. Subscribe to our announcem
 ents list to receive details for each week's session:&#160\;https://list.
 iu.edu/sympa/subscribe/kix-lab-announcements-l (https://list.iu.edu/sympa
 /subscribe/kix-lab-announcements-l)&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  These gatherings are meant to strengthe
 n our community through networking\, collaborative matchmaking\, and conn
 ecting with the KIX seed grants.</p><p>  Each week features a different p
 roject presentation or guest lecture\, followed by Q&amp\;A. Can't make i
 t in person? Join us by Zoom: <a href="https://iu.zoom.us/j/89765842070."
 >https://iu.zoom.us/j/89765842070.</a></p><p>  An optional lab tour follo
 ws at 10 am\; to make sure we can accommodate everyone\, please sign up f
 or the tour here: <a href="https://iubmsch-fireform.eas.iu.edu/online/for
 m/authen/mschkixtour">https://iubmsch-fireform.eas.iu.edu/online/form/aut
 hen/mschkixtour</a>&#160\;</p><p><strong>This Week's Topic:</strong> Embo
 died Dramaturgies: Exploring Motion Capture and Virtual Production as Too
 ls for the Transmission of Collective Performance Knowledge</p><p><strong
 >Presenter:</strong> Ana Candida Carneiro</p><p>  No registration is requ
 ired to attend. Subscribe to our announcements list to receive details fo
 r each week's session:&#160\;<a href="https://list.iu.edu/sympa/subscribe
 /kix-lab-announcements-l">https://list.iu.edu/sympa/subscribe/kix-lab-ann
 ouncements-l</a>&#160\;</p>
