LOCATION:Indiana University Bloomington
SUMMARY:2027 BioSpeculations Symposium
DESCRIPTION:The three-day symposium features an immersive bioart installa
 tion\, film screenings\, workshops\, invited talks\, a pop-up exhibition\
 , archival research opportunities\, panel discussions\, and a closing liv
 e performance. Guest speakers include Fiona Bell\, Jacklyn Brickman\, Eri
 n Espelie\, WhiteFeather Hunter\, Mary Maggic\, Lorelei D'Andriole\, and 
 Fannie (Shadow) Sosa.  Join us for conversations and creative exchange co
 nnecting experimental practices across the arts\, humanities\, and scienc
 es.
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p class="x12ofw9d">  The three-day symposiu
 m features an immersive bioart installation\, film screenings\, workshops
 \, invited talks\, a pop-up exhibition\, archival research opportunities\
 , panel discussions\, and a closing live performance. Guest speakers incl
 ude Fiona Bell\, Jacklyn Brickman\, Erin Espelie\, WhiteFeather Hunter\, 
 Mary Maggic\, Lorelei D'Andriole\, and Fannie (Shadow) Sosa.</p><p class=
 "x12ofw9d">  Join us for conversations and creative exchange connecting e
 xperimental practices across the arts\, humanities\, and sciences.</p>
